{
  "contest": {
    "title": "콘테스트",
    "missionTitle": "콘테스트에 참가해서 함께 즐기자！",
    "bodyHtml": "<div class=\"support-card support-card--wide\"><div class=\"support-top-stripe\"></div><div class=\"support-inner\"><div class=\"support-header\"><div class=\"support-main-title\">콘테스트</div><div class=\"support-sub-title\">너는 나를 어떤 모습으로 상상하고 있어?</div><div class=\"support-deco-line\">♡ ♡ ♡</div></div>\n\n<style>\n/* ── 콘테스트ページ専用スタイル ── */\n/* ── アクティブ콘테스트カード ── */\n.ct-active-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n  grid-template-rows: auto auto;\n  gap: 20px;\n  margin-bottom: 40px;\n  align-items: start;\n}\n@media(max-width:700px){.ct-active-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}\n\n.ct-contest-card {\n  border: 1px solid rgba(255,121,176,.2);\n  border-radius: 24px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: rgba(255,255,255,.02);\n  transition: transform .2s, box-shadow .2s;\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n.ct-contest-card:hover {\n  transform: translateY(-3px);\n  box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(255,121,176,.15);\n}\n.ct-contest-card[open] {\n  cursor: default;\n  transform: none;\n}\n.ct-contest-card summary {\n  list-style: none;\n  outline: none;\n}\n.ct-contest-card summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }\n\n.ct-card-thumb {\n  position: relative;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: rgba(0,0,0,.2);\n}\n.ct-card-thumb img {\n  width: 100%;\n  height: auto;\n  max-height: 320px;\n  object-fit: contain;\n  object-position: top center;\n  display: block;\n  transition: transform .3s;\n  background: rgba(0,0,0,.2);\n}\n.ct-contest-card:not([open]) .ct-card-thumb img:hover {\n  transform: scale(1.03);\n}\n.ct-card-badge {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 12px;\n  right: 12px;\n  padding: 4px 12px;\n  border-radius: 999px;\n  font-size: .75em;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  backdrop-filter: blur(6px);\n}\n.ct-card-badge--pink {\n  background: rgba(255,121,176,.85);\n  color: #fff;\n}\n.ct-card-badge--blue {\n  background: rgba(96,165,250,.85);\n  color: #fff;\n}\n.ct-card-badge--teal {\n  background: rgba(45,212,191,.85);\n  color: #fff;\n}\n\n.ct-card-body {\n  padding: 18px 20px 20px;\n}\n.ct-card-title {\n  font-family: 'Kaisei Tokumin', serif;\n  font-size: 1.1em;\n  font-weight: 900;\n  margin-bottom: 4px;\n  color: var(--text);\n}\n.ct-card-deadline {\n  font-size: .78em;\n  color: var(--muted);\n  margin-bottom: 10px;\n}\n.ct-card-desc {\n  font-size: .85em;\n  line-height: 1.7;\n  color: rgba(255,255,255,.75);\n  margin-bottom: 14px;\n}\n.ct-card-tags {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  gap: 6px;\n  margin-bottom: 14px;\n}\n.ct-card-tag {\n  padding: 3px 10px;\n  border-radius: 999px;\n  font-size: .75em;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  border: 1px solid rgba(255,121,176,.3);\n  color: var(--accent);\n  background: rgba(255,121,176,.07);\n}\n.ct-card-actions {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 8px;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n.ct-card-btn {\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 6px;\n  padding: 8px 16px;\n  border-radius: 999px;\n  font-size: .82em;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-decoration: none;\n  transition: opacity .15s, transform .1s;\n  border: none;\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n.ct-card-btn:hover { opacity: .85; transform: translateY(-1px); }\n.ct-card-btn--primary {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff79b0, #c084fc);\n  color: #fff;\n}\n.ct-card-btn--secondary {\n  background: rgba(255,255,255,.08);\n  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);\n  color: var(--text);\n}\n\n/* オニギリスライダー（カード内） */\n.ct-onigiri-slider { position: relative; overflow: hidden; border-radius: 0; }\n.ct-onigiri-track { display: flex; transition: transform .3s ease; }\n.ct-onigiri-slide { min-width: 100%; flex-shrink: 0; }\n.ct-onigiri-slide img { width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 320px; object-fit: contain; object-position: top; display: block; background: rgba(0,0,0,.2); }\n.ct-onigiri-nav {\n  position: absolute; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%);\n  width: 28px; height: 28px; border-radius: 50%;\n  background: rgba(0,0,0,.6); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3);\n  color: #fff; cursor: pointer; font-size: 14px;\n  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n  z-index: 5;\n}\n.ct-onigiri-nav--prev { left: 8px; }\n.ct-onigiri-nav--next { right: 8px; }\n.ct-onigiri-dots { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 6px; padding: 10px 0 0; }\n.ct-onigiri-dot {\n  width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%;\n  background: var(--accent); border: none; cursor: pointer; padding: 0;\n  opacity: .3; transition: opacity .2s;\n}\n.ct-onigiri-dot.active { opacity: 1; }\n\n/* ── 지난 콘테스트 ── */\n.ct-archive-section { margin-top: 48px; }\n.ct-archive-title {\n  font-size: 1.4em;\n  font-family: 'Kaisei Tokumin', serif;\n  font-weight: 900;\n  color: var(--accent);\n  text-align: center;\n  margin-bottom: 20px;\n  padding-bottom: 12px;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,121,176,.2);\n}\n.ct-archive-card {\n  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);\n  border-radius: 16px;\n  margin-bottom: 12px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: rgba(255,255,255,.02);\n}\n.ct-archive-summary {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 14px;\n  padding: 14px 18px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  user-select: none;\n}\n.ct-archive-summary { list-style: none; }\n.ct-archive-summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }\n.ct-archive-summary::marker { display: none; }\n.ct-archive-icon {\n  width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 12px;\n  background: rgba(255,255,255,.06);\n  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n  font-size: 20px; flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n.ct-archive-info { flex: 1; }\n.ct-archive-name { font-weight: 700; font-size: .95em; }\n.ct-archive-period { font-size: .78em; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 2px; }\n.ct-archive-arrow {\n  font-size: .8em; color: var(--muted);\n  transition: transform .2s;\n}\ndetails.ct-archive-card[open] .ct-archive-arrow { transform: rotate(180deg); }\n.ct-archive-inner { padding: 0 18px 20px; }\n\n/* 受賞作品グリッド */\n.ct-awards-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n  gap: 14px;\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n}\n@media(max-width:500px){.ct-awards-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px;}}\n.ct-awards-grid--four{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;}\n@media(max-width:500px){.ct-awards-grid--four{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;}}\n.ct-award-item { text-align: center; }\n.ct-award-label {\n  display: inline-block;\n  padding: 3px 12px;\n  border-radius: 999px;\n  font-size: .75em;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  margin-bottom: 6px;\n}\n.ct-award-label--gold { background: rgba(255,200,50,.15); color: #fde68a; border: 1px solid rgba(255,200,50,.3); }\n.ct-award-label--silver { background: rgba(180,180,220,.1); color: #c0c0e0; border: 1px solid rgba(180,180,220,.25); }\n.ct-award-name { font-size: .85em; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n.ct-award-img {\n  width: 100%; max-width: 280px;\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.4);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: transform .2s;\n}\n.ct-award-img:hover { transform: scale(1.02); }\n.ct-award-name a { transition: color .15s; }\n.ct-award-name a:hover { color: #ffaadd !important; text-decoration: underline !important; }\n/* ── 応募作品の保護（右クリック・長押し保存・ドラッグ禁止） ── */\n.ct-award-img, .ct-promo-btn img, .ct-award-video {\n  -webkit-touch-callout: none !important;\n  -webkit-user-select: none !important;\n  -moz-user-select: none !important;\n  user-select: none !important;\n  -webkit-user-drag: none !important;\n  user-drag: none !important;\n}\n\n/* アニメーション */\n@keyframes ct-fade-up {\n  from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(16px); }\n  to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }\n}\n.ct-contest-card {\n  animation: ct-fade-up .4s ease both;\n}\n.ct-contest-card:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: .08s; }\n.ct-contest-card:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: .16s; }\n.ct-promo-btn {\n  display: block;\n  width: 100%;\n  padding: 0;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  border: none;\n  background: none;\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  line-height: 0;\n}\n.ct-promo-btn img { display: block; width: 100%; }\n\n/* ── 詳細（開閉）エリア ── */\n.ct-card-more {\n  margin-top: 10px;\n  font-size: .78em;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--accent);\n  text-align: center;\n}\n.ct-contest-card[open] .ct-card-more { display: none; }\n.ct-card-detail {\n  padding: 4px 20px 22px;\n  border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,121,176,.15);\n  margin-top: 4px;\n  animation: ct-fade-up .3s ease both;\n}\n.ct-detail-lead {\n  font-size: .88em;\n  line-height: 1.8;\n  color: rgba(255,255,255,.85);\n  margin: 16px 0 18px;\n}\n.ct-detail-section { margin-bottom: 16px; }\n.ct-detail-heading {\n  font-weight: 900;\n  font-size: .92em;\n  color: var(--accent);\n  margin-bottom: 8px;\n}\n.ct-detail-list {\n  margin: 0;\n  padding-left: 1.3em;\n  font-size: .85em;\n  line-height: 1.9;\n  color: rgba(255,255,255,.8);\n}\n.ct-detail-list li { margin-bottom: 2px; }\n.ct-detail-text {\n  font-size: .85em;\n  line-height: 1.9;\n  color: rgba(255,255,255,.8);\n}\n</style>\n\n<!-- ===== アクティブ콘테스트 ===== -->\n<div class=\"ct-active-grid\">\n\n  <!-- ハロウィンオニギリラクーンコンテスト -->\n  <div class=\"ct-contest-card\">\n      <div class=\"ct-card-thumb\">\n        <img src=\"./assets/オニギリラクーンコンテストハロウィン.png\" alt=\"할로윈 오니기리 라쿤 콘테스트\" onclick=\"openLightbox('./assets/オニギリラクーンコンテストハロウィン.png')\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;max-height:320px;object-fit:contain;display:block;background:rgba(0,0,0,.2);cursor:zoom-in;\" />\n        <span class=\"ct-card-badge ct-card-badge--blue\">📅 10월 25일(일) 마감</span>\n      </div>\n    <div class=\"ct-card-body\">\n      <div class=\"ct-card-title\">할로윈🎃 오니기리 라쿤 콘테스트</div>\n      <div class=\"ct-card-deadline\">마감：10월 25일 (일)</div>\n      <div class=\"ct-card-desc\">모자를 씌우거나 소지품을 들게 하거나 해서 개성 넘치는 할로윈 오니기리라쿤을 디자인하자！마음에 드는 이미지를 사용해서 응모해줘. 1인당 몇 장이든 OK！해시태그는 #오니기리라쿤 을 사용하고, 이미지는 할로윈용 이미지를 사용해주세요！</div>\n      <div class=\"ct-card-actions\">\n        <a href=\"https://x.com/hashtag/%E3%82%AA%E3%83%8B%E3%82%AE%E3%83%AA%E3%83%A9%E3%82%AF%E3%83%BC%E3%83%B3?src=hashtag_click&f=live\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"ct-card-btn ct-card-btn--primary\">👀 모두의 작품 보기</a>\n        <a href=\"./assets/オニギリラクーンコンテストハロウィン.png\" download class=\"ct-card-btn ct-card-btn--secondary\">⬇ 이미지 다운①</a>\n        <a href=\"./assets/オニギリラクーンコンテストハロウィン2.png\" download class=\"ct-card-btn ct-card-btn--secondary\">⬇ 이미지 다운②</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- オニギリラクーン콘테스트 -->\n  <div class=\"ct-contest-card\">\n      <div class=\"ct-card-thumb\">\n        <div class=\"ct-onigiri-slider\">\n          <button class=\"ct-onigiri-nav ct-onigiri-nav--prev\" onclick=\"onigiriGo(Math.max(0,(window._onigiriIndex||0)-1));event.stopPropagation()\">‹</button>\n          <button class=\"ct-onigiri-nav ct-onigiri-nav--next\" onclick=\"onigiriGo(Math.min(1,(window._onigiriIndex||0)+1));event.stopPropagation()\">›</button>\n          <div class=\"ct-onigiri-track\" id=\"onigiriTrack\">\n            <div class=\"ct-onigiri-slide\"><img src=\"./assets/オニギリラクーンコンテスト.png\" alt=\"オニギリラクーン1\" onclick=\"openLightbox('./assets/オニギリラクーンコンテスト.png')\" /></div>\n            <div class=\"ct-onigiri-slide\"><img src=\"./assets/オニギリラクーンコンテスト2.png\" alt=\"オニギリラクーン2\" onclick=\"openLightbox('./assets/オニギリラクーンコンテスト2.png')\" /></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <span class=\"ct-card-badge ct-card-badge--blue\">∞ 상시 응모 가능</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"ct-onigiri-dots\" style=\"background:rgba(0,0,0,.2);padding:8px 0;\">\n        <button class=\"ct-onigiri-dot active\" onclick=\"onigiriGo(0);event.stopPropagation()\"></button>\n        <button class=\"ct-onigiri-dot\" onclick=\"onigiriGo(1);event.stopPropagation()\"></button>\n      </div>\n    <div class=\"ct-card-body\">\n      <div class=\"ct-card-title\">🍙 오니기리 라쿤 콘테스트</div>\n      <div class=\"ct-card-deadline\">마감：미정（상시 응모 OK！）</div>\n      <div class=\"ct-card-desc\">모자를 씌우거나 소지품을 들게 하거나 해서 개성 넘치는 오니기리라쿤을 디자인하자！마음에 드는 이미지를 사용해서 응모해줘. 1인당 몇 장이든 OK！</div>\n      <div class=\"ct-card-actions\">\n        <a href=\"https://x.com/hashtag/%E3%82%AA%E3%83%8B%E3%82%AE%E3%83%AA%E3%83%A9%E3%82%AF%E3%83%BC%E3%83%B3?src=hashtag_click&f=live\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"ct-card-btn ct-card-btn--primary\">👀 모두의 작품 보기</a>\n        <a href=\"./assets/オニギリラクーンコンテスト.png\" download class=\"ct-card-btn ct-card-btn--secondary\">⬇ 이미지 다운①</a>\n        <a href=\"./assets/オニギリラクーンコンテスト2.png\" download class=\"ct-card-btn ct-card-btn--secondary\">⬇ 이미지 다운②</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- 切り抜き動画콘테스트（1カラム幅） -->\n  <div class=\"ct-contest-card\">\n      <div class=\"ct-card-thumb\">\n        <img src=\"./assets/切り抜き動画コンテスト.png\" alt=\"切り抜き動画콘테스트\" onclick=\"openLightbox('./assets/切り抜き動画コンテスト.png')\" />\n        <span class=\"ct-card-badge ct-card-badge--teal\">∞ 상시 응모</span>\n      </div>\n    <div class=\"ct-card-body\">\n      <div class=\"ct-card-title\">✂️ 切り抜き動画콘테스트</div>\n      <div class=\"ct-card-deadline\">상시 응모 가능</div>\n      <div class=\"ct-card-desc\">완성된 영상은 X DM 또는 이메일로 보내주세요！응모 기한은 폐지했어요, 언제든지 응모 OK！</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- ===== 지난 콘테스트 ===== -->\n<div class=\"ct-archive-section\">\n  <div class=\"ct-archive-title\">📂 지난 콘테스트</div>\n\n  <!-- 3rd Mitarai THE Summer Illustration Contest -->\n  <details class=\"ct-archive-card\" open id=\"contest-round3\">\n    <summary class=\"ct-archive-summary\">\n      <div class=\"ct-archive-icon\">☀️</div>\n      <div class=\"ct-archive-info\">\n        <div class=\"ct-archive-name\">제3회 미타라이 THE 서머 일러스트 콘테스트</div>\n        <div class=\"ct-archive-period\">2026년 7월~8월 17일 / 종료</div>\n      </div>\n      <span class=\"ct-archive-arrow\">▼</span>\n    </summary>\n    <div class=\"ct-archive-inner\">\n      <div style=\"font-weight:700;color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:14px;font-size:.9em;\">🏆 수상작</div>\n      <div class=\"ct-awards-grid ct-awards-grid--four\">\n        <div class=\"ct-award-item\">\n          <div><span class=\"ct-award-label ct-award-label--gold\">🤍 등신상</span></div>\n          <div class=\"ct-award-name\"><a href=\"https://x.com/currysushinatto/status/2083514433402450418\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none;\">寿司ガキ</a></div>\n          <img src=\"./assets/寿司ガキ.png\" alt=\"🤍 등신상 寿司ガキ\" class=\"ct-award-img\" draggable=\"false\" oncontextmenu=\"return false;\" onclick=\"openLightbox('./assets/寿司ガキ.png', true)\" />\n          <div style=\"font-size:.82em;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px;line-height:1.7;\">여름을 마음껏 즐기는 저를 그려주셨어요! 작살과 스노클을 들고 진짜로 물고기를 잡으러 갈 기세인 게 너무 웃겨요ㅋㅋ 반짝반짝 즐거운 표정도 정말 멋져요!</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"ct-award-item\">\n          <div><span class=\"ct-award-label ct-award-label--gold\">🖤 미니 캐릭터상</span></div>\n          <div class=\"ct-award-name\"><a href=\"https://x.com/Capitano_k4/status/2088605033739018535\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none;\">カピカピターノ</a></div>\n          <img src=\"./assets/カピカピターノ.png\" alt=\"🖤 미니 캐릭터상 カピカピターノ\" class=\"ct-award-img\" draggable=\"false\" oncontextmenu=\"return false;\" onclick=\"openLightbox('./assets/カピカピターノ.png', true)\" />\n          <div style=\"font-size:.82em;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px;line-height:1.7;\">수영복과 가방 디자인이 너무 마음에 들어요! 여름 더위 따위 아무렇지 않은 쿨한 표정이<br>멋있어요꒰꒱(⑅︎ᐢ ͈ ᴗ̀ ̫ᴗ́ ͈ᐢ )<br>테마 컬러인 화이트와 블랙을 유지하면서도 새로운 여름 느낌을 전해줬어요🤍</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"ct-award-item\">\n          <div><span class=\"ct-award-label ct-award-label--gold\">⭐ 특별상</span></div>\n          <div class=\"ct-award-name\"><a href=\"https://x.com/H__0v0__/status/2089404334039810335\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none;\">もんにゃん</a></div>\n          <img src=\"./assets/もんにゃん.png\" alt=\"⭐ 특별상 もんにゃん\" class=\"ct-award-img\" draggable=\"false\" oncontextmenu=\"return false;\" onclick=\"openLightbox('./assets/もんにゃん.png', true)\" />\n          <div style=\"font-size:.82em;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px;line-height:1.7;\