=\"ct-award-name\">응모 없음</div>\n          <div style=\"height:80px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:.85em;border:1px dashed rgba(255,255,255,.15);border-radius:12px;\">－</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"ct-award-item\">\n          <div><span class=\"ct-award-label ct-award-label--gold\">⭐ 특별상</span></div>\n          <div class=\"ct-award-name\"><a href=\"https://x.com/EbiNaChoss0816\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none;\">えびなちょす</a></div>\n          <img src=\"./assets/えびなちょす.png\" alt=\"특별상 えびなちょす\" class=\"ct-award-img\" draggable=\"false\" oncontextmenu=\"return false;\" onclick=\"openLightbox('./assets/えびなちょす.png', true)\" />\n          <div style=\"font-size:.82em;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px;line-height:1.7;\">제목「시골에 살았다면」　ㅋㅋㅋ</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"ct-award-item\">\n          <div><span class=\"ct-award-label ct-award-label--gold\">🎬 애니메이션상</span></div>\n          <div class=\"ct-award-name\"><a href=\"https://x.com/WChin1997\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none;\">しののん</a></div>\n          <video src=\"./assets/しののん.mp4\" autoplay muted loop playsinline controls controlsList=\"nodownload noremoteplayback\" disablePictureInPicture oncontextmenu=\"return false;\" class=\"ct-award-video\"\n            style=\"width:100%;max-width:280px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.4);\"></video>\n          <div style=\"font-size:.82em;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px;line-height:1.7;\">머리카락·스커트·꼬리가 살랑살랑 너무 귀엽고, 표정도 나다워서 사랑이 느껴져요！🤍</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </details>\n\n  <!-- 塗り絵콘테스트 -->\n  <details class=\"ct-archive-card\" open>\n    <summary class=\"ct-archive-summary\">\n      <div class=\"ct-archive-icon\">🎨</div>\n      <div class=\"ct-archive-info\">\n        <div class=\"ct-archive-name\">새로운 의상색칠하기콘테스트</div>\n        <div class=\"ct-a