    "title": "",
    "bodyHtml": "<div class=\"support-card support-card--wide\"><div class=\"support-top-stripe\"></div><div class=\"support-inner\"><div class=\"support-header\"><div class=\"support-main-title\">색칠해보기</div><div class=\"support-sub-title\">새로운 의상색칠하기콘테스트</div><div class=\"support-deco-line\">♡ ♡ ♡</div></div><div class=\"ct-mobile-only-hint\" style=\"text-align:center;font-weight:700;color:#ff79b0;margin-bottom:18px;font-size:.9em;line-height:1.6;\">스마트폰 이용자분들께: 브라우저 설정에서 「PC 버전 보기」를 켠 후, 가로 화면으로 조작하시는 것을 권장합니다.</div><div class=\"inner\" id=\"contest-root\">\n      <a href=\"#contest\" class=\"ct-btn ct-btn--gray\" style=\"display:inline-flex;margin-bottom:14px;text-decoration:none;\">← 콘테스트 페이지로 돌아가기</a>\n      <div style=\"padding:12px 16px;border-radius:12px;background:rgba(255,200,50,.08);border:1px solid rgba(255,200,50,.25);color:#fde68a;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:14px;\">⚠️ 콘테스트 응모 기간이 종료되어 입상하실 수 없습니다.</div>\n      <style>\n      #contest-root{width:100%;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Noto Sans JP',sans-serif;}\n      .ct-mobile-only-hint{display:none;}\n      @media(max-width:768px){.ct-mobile-only-hint{display:block;}}\n      .ct-dlbar{position:relative;margin-bottom:18px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);border-radius:14px;padding:16px 52px 16px 18px;overflow:visible;}\n      .ct-dlbar-close{position:absolute;top:10px;right:10px;z-index:10;width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(255,255,255,.15);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.25);color:var(--text);cursor:pointer;font-size:13px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;}\n      .ct-dlbtns{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;}\n      .ct-dlbtn{flex:1;min-width:160px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;padding:13px 18px;border-radius:12px;font-weight:700;font-size:.95em;text-decoration:none;transition:opacity .15s,transform .1s;}\n      .ct-dlbtn:hover{opacity:.85;transform:translateY(-1px);}\n      .ct-dlbtn--purple{background:rgba(147,51,234,.85);color:#fff;}\n      .ct-dlbtn--dark{background:#1f1f25;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);color:var(--text);}\n      .ct-dlnote{margin-top:10px;font-size:.82em;color:var(--muted);}\n      .ct-status-yellow{background:rgba(234,179,8,.1);border-left:4px solid #eab308;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:0 10px 10px 0;margin-bottom:14px;color:#fde68a;}\n      .ct-status-red{background:rgba(239,68,68,.1);border-left:4px solid #ef4444;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:0 10px 10px 0;margin-bottom:14px;color:#fca5a5;}\n      .ct-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:16px;margin-bottom:16px;}\n      .ct-card{background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.10);border-radius:14px;padding:18px;}\n      .ct-card--canvas{border-color:rgba(147,51,234,.3);}\n      .ct-canvas-wrap{border:3px solid rgba(147,51,234,.3);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff;margin-bottom:14px;}\n      .ct-canvas-wrap canvas{width:100%;height:auto;display:block;}\n      .ct-hsv-picker{position:relative;width:100%;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;cursor:crosshair;margin-bottom:8px;min-height:160px;}\n      .ct-hsv-sat{position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(to right,#fff,transparent);}\n      .ct-hsv-bri{position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(to bottom,transparent,#000);}\n      .ct-hsv-cursor-dot{position:absolute;width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:50%;border:2.5px solid #fff;box-shadow:0 0 0 1.5px rgba(0,0,0,.8);pointer-events:none;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);top:0%;left:100%;}\n      .ct-canvas-btns{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;}\n      .ct-canvas-row{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:stretch;flex-wrap:wrap;}\n      .ct-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:6px;padding:11px 16px;border-radius:10px;font-weight:700;font-size:.88em;cursor:pointer;border:none;transition:opacity .15s,transform .1s;}\n      .ct-btn:hover{opacity:.85;transform:translateY(-1px);}\n      .ct-btn--pink{background:rgba(236,72,153,.8);color:#fff;}\n      .ct-btn--green{background:rgba(22,163,74,.8);color:#fff;}\n      .ct-btn--blue{background:rgba(59,130,246,.8);color:#fff;}\n      .ct-btn--gray{background:rgba(255,255,255,.1);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);color:var(--text);}\n      .ct-desktop-controls{display:contents;}\n      .ct-palette-card{background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.10);border-radius:14px;padding:16px;}\n      .ct-label{display:block;font-size:.82em;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:6px;font-weight:600;}\n      .ct-colorbar-wrap{position:relative;width:100%;height:20px;margin-bottom:10px;cursor:pointer;border-radius:6px;background:linear-gradient(to right,hsl(0,100%,50%),hsl(30,100%,50%),hsl(60,100%,50%),hsl(90,100%,50%),hsl(120,100%,50%),hsl(150,100%,50%),hsl(180,100%,50%),hsl(210,100%,50%),hsl(240,100%,50%),hsl(270,100%,50%),hsl(300,100%,50%),hsl(330,100%,50%),hsl(360,100%,50%));}\n      .ct-colorbar-wrap canvas{display:none;}\n      .ct-colorcursor{position:absolute;width:3px;height:40px;background:#fff;border-radius:2px;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px #000;pointer-events:none;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);}\n      .ct-preview-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:10px;}\n      .ct-colorpreview{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:8px;border:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2);flex-shrink:0;}\n      .ct-hex{flex:1;background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);border-radius:8px;padding:7px 10px;color:var(--text);font-size:.88em;width:100%;}\n      .ct-add-btn{background:rgba(59,130,246,.7);color:#fff;border:none;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;font-size:.82em;white-space:nowrap;}\n      .ct-mypalette-header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:6px;}\n      .ct-mypalette-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(6,1fr);gap:6px;min-height:36px;padding:8px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.03);border-radius:8px;border:2px dashed rgba(255,255,255,.1);}\n      .ct-palette-swatch{aspect-ratio:1;border-radius:6px;cursor:pointer;border:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2);position:relative;}\n      .ct-apply-btn{width:100%;margin-top:10px;background:rgba(147,51,234,.8);color:#fff;border:none;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;font-weight:700;font-size:.9em;cursor:pointer;transition:opacity .15s;}\n      .ct-layer-card{background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.10);border-radius:14px;padding:16px;}\n      .ct-layer-header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:12px;}\n      .ct-layer-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;max-height:340px;overflow-y:auto;}\n      .ct-layer-item{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:10px;border:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);background:rgba(255,255,255,.03);cursor:pointer;transition:border-color .15s,background .15s;}\n      .ct-layer-item:hover{border-color:rgba(147,51,234,.4);}\n      .ct-layer-item.selected{background:rgba(147,51,234,.12);border-color:rgba(147,51,234,.6);}\n      .ct-layer-item.fixed{background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);cursor:default;}\n      .ct-layer-left{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;}\n      .ct-layer-swatch{width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:5px;border:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2);flex-shrink:0;}\n      .ct-layer-name{font-size:.88em;font-weight:600;}\n      .ct-eye-btn{background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;font-size:18px;padding:2px 4px;border-radius:6px;transition:background .1s;}\n      .ct-panel-overlay{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(0,0,0,.55);opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:opacity .3s;z-index:999;}\n      .ct-panel-overlay.active{opacity:1;pointer-events:auto;}\n      .ct-slide-panel{position:fixed;top:0;right:-100%;width:85%;max-width:400px;height:100vh;background:#17171c;border-left:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);transition:right .3s;z-index:1000;overflow-y:auto;}\n      .ct-slide-panel.active{right:0;}\n      .ct-panel-inner{padding:16px;}\n      .ct-panel-toggle,.ct-panel-overlay,.ct-slide-panel,.ct-panel-close,.ct-panel-close-btn{display:none!important;}\n      .ct-howto{margin-top:16px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.10);border-radius:14px;padding:18px;}\n      .ct-modal{display:none;position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:9999;background:rgba(0,0,0,.85);padding:16px;flex-direction:column;}\n      .ct-modal.active{display:flex;}\n      .ct-modal-header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;position:relative;z-index:10000;}\n      .ct-modal-controls{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;position:relative;z-index:10000;}\n      .ct-modal-close{width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(255,255,255,.15);border:none;color:#fff;font-size:18px;cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;z-index:10000;position:relative;}\n      .ct-modal-body{flex:1;overflow:auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;cursor:pointer;}\n      .ct-modal-img{max-width:100%;max-height:100%;object-fit:contain;transition:transform .2s;transform-origin:center center;}\n      .ct-eyedrop-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:6px;padding:11px 14px;border-radius:10px;font-weight:700;font-size:.88em;cursor:pointer;border:none;background:rgba(255,255,255,.10);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);color:var(--text);transition:opacity .15s,transform .1s;white-space:nowrap;}\n      .ct-eyedrop-hint{font-size:.78em;color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px;text-align:center;display:none;}\n      </style>\n\n      <div id=\"ct-dlbar\" class=\"ct-dlbar\">\n        <button id=\"ct-dlbar-close\" class=\"ct-dlbar-close\" aria-label=\"닫기\">✕</button>\n        <div class=\"ct-dlbtns\">\n          <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/n13n83mqwtiwywacephep/school_uniform_4.png?rlkey=oxty5v4n90824d0ns8s17lnt9&st=0t1vqzda&dl=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"ct-dlbtn ct-dlbtn--purple\">⬇️ 색칠 전 이미지 다운로드</a>\n          <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/mpzj8h3v5s3ld0tc44eko/mitaraiasobu_nurie.psd?rlkey=ypbedwxtmghoibcrh458yz68s&st=oil5j8ix&dl=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"ct-dlbtn ct-dlbtn--dark\">⬇️ PSD 다운로드</a>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"ct-dlnote\">※필요 없으면 오른쪽 위의 ✕ 로 숨길 수 있어요</div>\n      </div>\n      <div id=\"ct-loading\" class=\"ct-status-yellow\" style=\"display:none;\">⏳ 이미지를 불러오는 중...</div>\n      <div id=\"ct-error\" class=\"ct-status-red\" style=\"display:none;\"><b>❌ 일부 이미지를 불러오지 못했습니다</b></div>\n      <div class=\"ct-grid\">\n        <div class=\"ct-card ct-card--canvas\">\n          <div class=\"ct-canvas-wrap\"><canvas id=\"ct-canvas\"></canvas></div>\n          <div class=\"ct-canvas-btns\">\n            <div class=\"ct-canvas-row\">\n              <a href=\"https://x.com/search?q=%23%E5%BE%A1%E6%89%8B%E6%B4%97%E3%81%BF%E3%81%9F%E3%82%89&src=hashtag_click&f=live\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"ct-btn ct-btn--pink\" style=\"flex:1;\">👀 모두의 작품 보기</a>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"ct-canvas-row\">\n              <button id=\"ct-download\" class=\"ct-btn ct-btn--green\" style=\"flex:1;\">📥 이미지 다운로드</button>\n              <button id=\"ct-tweet\" class=\"ct-btn ct-btn--blue\" style=\"flex:1;\">🐦 트위터에 게시</button>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"ct-desktop-controls\" id=\"ct-desktop-controls-wrap\">\n          <div class=\"ct-palette-card\">\n            <div id=\"ct-hsv-picker\" class=\"ct-hsv-picker\" style=\"background:#ff0000;\">\n              <div class=\"ct-hsv-sat\"></div><div class=\"ct-hsv-bri\"></div>\n              <div id=\"ct-hsv-cursor\" class=\"ct-hsv-cursor-dot\"></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"ct-colorbar-wrap\" style=\"margin-bottom:10px;height:20px;\">\n              <canvas id=\"ct-colorbar\" style=\"height:20px;border-radius:6px;display:block;width:100%;\"></canvas>\n              <div id=\"ct-cursor\" class=\"ct-colorcursor\" style=\"left:0%;height:28px;top:50%;\"></div>\n            </div>\n            <div id=\"ct-eyedrop-hint\" class=\"ct-eyedrop-hint\">캔버스의 색을 클릭해서 취득 중...</div>\n            <div class=\"ct-preview-row\">\n              <div id=\"ct-preview\" class=\"ct-colorpreview\" style=\"background:#ff0000;\"></div>\n              <input type=\"text\" id=\"ct-hex\" class=\"ct-hex\" value=\"#ff0000\">\n              <button id=\"ct-eyedrop\" class=\"ct-eyedrop-btn\">스포이드</button>\n              <button id=\"ct-add-palette\" class=\"ct-add-btn\">➕ 등록</button>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"ct-mypalette-header\">\n              <span class=\"ct-label\" style=\"margin:0;\">💾 나의 팔레트</span>\n              <button id=\"ct-reset-palette\" class=\"ct-btn ct-btn--gray\" style=\"padding:5px 10px;font-size:.75em;\">🗑️ 리셋</button>\n            </div>\n            <div id=\"ct-custom-palette\" class=\"ct-mypalette-grid\"></div>\n            <button id=\"ct-apply\" class=\"ct-apply-btn\">선택한 레이어에 칠하기</button>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"ct-layer-card\">\n            <div class=\"ct-layer-header\">\n              <button id=\"ct-reset-all\" class=\"ct-btn ct-btn--gray\" style=\"padding:6px 12px;font-size:.8em;\">🔄 리셋</button>\n            </div>\n            <div id=\"ct-layer-list\" class=\"ct-layer-list\"></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div id=\"ct-overlay\" class=\"ct-panel-overlay\"></div>\n      <button id=\"ct-panel-close-btn\" class=\"ct-panel-close\">▶</button>\n      <div id=\"ct-slide-panel\" class=\"ct-slide-panel\">\n        <div class=\"ct-panel-inner\">\n          <div style=\"position:sticky;top:0;z-index:10;background:#17171c;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);margin-bottom:14px;\">\n            <button id=\"ct-apply-m\" class=\"ct-apply-btn\">선택한 레이어에 칠하기</button>\n          </div>\n          <div id=\"ct-hsv-picker-m\" class=\"ct-hsv-picker\" style=\"background:#ff0000;\">\n            <div class=\"ct-hsv-sat\"></div><div class=\"ct-hsv-bri\"></div>\n            <div id=\"ct-hsv-cursor-m\" class=\"ct-hsv-cursor-dot\"></div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"ct-colorbar-wrap\" style=\"margin-bottom:10px;height:20px;\">\n            <canvas id=\"ct-colorbar-m\" style=\"height:20px;border-radius:6px;display:block;width:100%;\"></canvas>\n            <div id=\"ct-cursor-m\" class=\"ct-colorcursor\" style=\"left:0%;height:28px;top:50%;\"></div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"ct-preview-row\" style=\"margin-top:8px;\">\n            <div id=\"ct-preview-m\" class=\"ct-colorpreview\" style=\"background:#ff0000;\"></div>\n            <input type=\"text\" id=\"ct-hex-m\" class=\"ct-hex\" value=\"#ff0000\">\n            <button id=\"ct-add-palette-m\" class=\"ct-add-btn\">➕</button>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"ct-mypalette-header\" style=\"margin-top:10px;\">\n            <span class=\"ct-label\" style=\"margin:0;\">💾 나의 팔레트</span>\n            <button id=\"ct-reset-palette-m\" class=\"ct-btn ct-btn--gray\" style=\"padding:4px 8px;font-size:.75em;\">🗑️</button>\n          </div>\n          <div id=\"ct-custom-palette-m\" class=\"ct-mypalette-grid\"></div>\n          <div style=\"border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);margin-top:18px;padding-top:16px;\">\n            <div class=\"ct-layer-header\">\n              <span style=\"font-weight:900;\">📚 レイヤー</span>\n              <button id=\"ct-reset-all-m\" class=\"ct-btn ct-btn--gray\" style=\"padding:6px 12px;font-size:.8em;\">🔄 리셋</button>\n            </div>\n            <div id=\"ct-layer-list-m\" class=\"ct-layer-list\" style=\"max-height:360px;\"></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"ct-howto\">\n        <div style=\"font-weight:900;margin-bottom:8px;\">📖 사용법</div>\n        <ol>\n          <li>색상 사각형 영역을 클릭/드래그해서 색을 선택（가로→채도, 세로→명도）</li>\n          <li>무지개색 바(색상)에서 색 계열을 선택하고, 사각형 영역에서 밝기와 선명도를 조절하세요. 마음에 들면 '➕ 등록'을 눌러 저장합니다.</li>\n          <li>레이어 패널에서 칠하고 싶은 레이어를 선택（레이어 1은 고정으로 변경 불가）</li>\n          <li>「선택한 레이어에 칠하기」ボタンをクリック</li>\n          <li>👁️ 아이콘으로 레이어 표시/숨기기 전환</li>\n          <li>완성되면 「이미지 다운로드」또는 「트위터에 게시」</li>\n        </ol>\n      </div>\n      <div id=\"ct-img-modal\" class=\"ct-modal\">\n        <div class=\"ct-modal-header\">\n          <div class=\"ct-modal-controls\">\n            <button id=\"ct-zoom-reset\" class=\"ct-btn ct-btn--gray\" style=\"padding:6px 12px;font-size:.82em;\">🔄 100%</button>\n            <input type=\"range\" id=\"ct-zoom-slider\" min=\"50\" max=\"200\" value=\"100\" style=\"width:100px;accent-color:#9333ea;\">\n            <span id=\"ct-zoom-pct\" style=\"color:#fff;font-size:.88em;min-width:2.5rem;\">100%</span>\n          </div>\n          <button id=\"ct-modal-close\" class=\"ct-modal-close\">✕</button>\n        </div>\n        <div id=\"ct-modal-backdrop\" class=\"ct-modal-body\">\n          <img id=\"ct-modal-img\" class=\"ct-modal-img\" src=\"\" alt=\"\">\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    </div><div class=\"support-footer\"><div class=\"support-footer-hearts\">♡ ♡ ♡</div><div class=\"support-footer-name\">미타라이 아소부</div><div class=\"support-footer-roman\">Mitarai Asobu</div></div></div></div>"
  }
}